1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Hello, how are you?
Xin chào, bạn khỏe không?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
I am fine, thank you.
Tôi khỏe, cảm ơn bạn.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
What is your name?
Bạn tên là gì?

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
My name is John.
Tên tôi là John.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Nice to meet you.
Rất vui được gặp bạn.
